{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"18738","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/18738","key":"MC-267273","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"10/Dec/23 11:14 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>When the player chooses a beacon power on a full beacon and then hovers the mouse over the second level of that power, the description popup flickers rapidly. This does not happen with the other beacon powers.</p>\n\n<p>To reproduce:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Create a new world in creative mode. (This can also be reproduced in survival but creative mode is easier.)</li>\n\t<li>Create a full beacon (4 levels).</li>\n\t<li>Choose a beacon power (left side of beacon UI).</li>\n\t<li>Hover the mouse over the icon for level 2 of that power (right side of beacon UI). The description popup will flicker rapidly.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>The flickering cannot be seen for the other six power icons.</p>\n\n<p>A screenshot is attached showing where the problem will be seen.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"11/Dec/23 2:58 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/33665","id":"33665","filename":"2023-12-11 15-55-40.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:febf45cf-66f3-400c-a764-a4ff9578615c/e3083fac-7516-474e-867b-d47767014fb5/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:febf45cf-66f3-400c-a764-a4ff9578615c/e3083fac-7516-474e-867b-d47767014fb5/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:febf45cf-66f3-400c-a764-a4ff9578615c/e3083fac-7516-474e-867b-d477670